---
/**
 * Hard Rule 1: A visible Demo ribbon on every page.
 * Hard Rule 5: Test mode disclaimer.
 */
---
<aside aria-label="Demo notice banner" class="bg-lemon text-charcoal py-1.5 px-4 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide border-b border-charcoal/10 relative z-50">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto flex items-center justify-between gap-3 text-center sm:text-left">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mx-auto sm:mx-0">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-charcoal text-lemon text-[10px] uppercase font-bold tracking-wider">
        DEMO
      </span>
      <span>
        Fictional concept for Nigerian restaurants. All phone numbers, payments, and bank accounts are simulated in test mode.
      </span>
    </div>
    <a href="/for-owners" class="hidden sm:inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-bold text-charcoal underline hover:opacity-80 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-charcoal rounded px-1">
      For Restaurant Owners →
    </a>
  </div>
</aside>
